      "text": "914263"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "Located in London (London City Centre), Grand Plaza Serviced Apartments is within a 15-minute walk of Kensington Gardens and Kensington Palace.  This aparthotel is 0.8 mi (1.2 km) from Paddington Central and 1 mi (1.6 km) from Hyde Park."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 198 guestrooms, featuring kitchenettes with refrigerators and stovetops. Flat-screen televisions with cable programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and microwaves."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take in the views from a rooftop terrace and make use of amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access and concierge services. Additional amenities at this aparthotel include a television in a common area, a reception hall, and a vending machine."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EQueensway - 0.3 km / 0.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Gardens - 0.4 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Portobello Road Market - 0.7 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington Palace - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Paddington Central - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Kensington High Street - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Hyde Park - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Imperial College London - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Royal Albert Hall - 2 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Science Museum - 2.5 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Cromwell Road - 2.5 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Marble Arch - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Natural History Museum - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Park Lane - 2.6 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Westfield London Shopping Centre - 2.7 km / 1.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELondon City Airport (LCY) - 19.8 km / 12.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Heathrow Airport (LHR) - 24.8 km / 15.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Gatwick Airport (LGW) - 92.6 km / 57.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Luton Airport (LTN) - 51.5 km / 32 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Grand Plaza Serviced Apartments is Heathrow Airport (LHR). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has not indicated whether there is a carbon monoxide detector on the property; consider bringing a portable detector with you on the trip\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has indicated there is a smoke detector on the property\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property is professionally cleaned\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EParking height restrictions apply. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property is professionally cleaned.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Enjoy a meal at the restaurant, or stay in and take advantage of the aparthotel\u0027s room service (during limited hours). Continental breakfasts are served on weekdays from 7:00 AM to 11:00 AM and on weekends from 8:00 AM to 11:00 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
